Package: tlfstack
Title: Convention-Driven Clinical Tables, Listings, and Figures in RTF
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jaime", "Yan", , "yanmingyunmt@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: A convention stack for submission-style clinical reporting:
    pure builder functions turn analysis data into tables, listings and
    figures; a convention engine applies page geometry, fonts and title
    blocks when rendering to Rich Text Format (RTF) through 'r2rtf'; a
    title resolver reads titles and footnotes from a table-of-contents
    source with live, snapshot and fallback modes; and figure rendering
    can run in an isolated child process with bounded retries. The same
    builders serve scheduled batch programs and interactive previews.
